TI  - "It's Confusing, Insecure, and Messy" – Mapping the Gaps Between Stakeholders' Cybersecurity Mental Models in the Danish Defence Sector
AU  - Kankam-Boateng, Judith
AU  - Peressotti, Marco
AU  - Stentoft, Jan
AU  - Jensen, Kent Wickstrøm
